WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.511
The applied assessment asks you to produce one row
per customer with cleaned fields a

00:00:04.524 --> 00:00:10.112
quality status and a duplicate rank Do not overwrite
the customer

00:00:10.138 --> 00:00:16.631
source table Build the solution in stages Start

00:00:16.657 --> 00:00:22.757
with normalization Add validation Then

00:00:22.784 --> 00:00:30.168
add duplicate ranking Finally create the row-level
status Run

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:33.418
each stage as you build it so errors remain easy to
locate
